rule-failure.IssueARead.1                                => test:test_a_read_that_arrives_is_not_retried_at_all exercises=kd_read
rule-failure.IssueARead.2                                => test:test_a_read_that_arrives_is_not_retried_at_all exercises=kd_read
rule-entity-creation.IssueARead.1                        => test:test_a_read_that_arrives_is_not_retried_at_all exercises=kd_read
rule-success.TakeTheAnswer                               => test:test_the_reply_is_read_from_the_log_and_cut_to_what_arrived exercises=_wait_read
